# ============================================================================
# .gitignore — SI-KKPRIS (Opsi B: Khusus Kode Implementasi, DDL & Log Kerja)
# ============================================================================

# 1. Abaikan Folder Dokumen Analisis, Riset, Wireframe & Berkas UTS
/01_Manajemen Proyek/
/02_Riset & Wawancara/
/03_Analisis & Diagram/
/04_Wireframe & Desain UI/
/UTS/
/README.md

# 2. Abaikan Konfigurasi Editor / Agen Lokal
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/

# 3. Python & Django Environment
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal
*.log
local_settings.py
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 4. Media Uploads (Berkas KTP, Agunan, Bukti Transfer Lokal)
05_Implementasi/**/media/*
!05_Implementasi/**/media/.gitkeep
05_Implementasi/**/staticfiles/

# 5. OS Generated Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
~$*
